  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "經學專題",
    "sub_ename": "CLASSIC TOPIC",
    "describe_ch": "「經典」代表文明的上層結構，它不只是文獻材料，而是關聯著一個文明對於人性、世界觀、知識論與價值觀的普遍覺知。理解「經」所代表的意義以及價值，將能深刻把握住此文明之核心精神。本課程將以思想為核心，文獻為內容，歷史為舞臺，引導學生進入中華經典的堂奧。",
    "describe_eh": "\"Classic\" represents the superstructure of a civilization. It is not just textual material, but a universal understanding of humanity, worldview, epistemology, and values of an entire civilization. Understanding the meaning and value of \"Classic\" will enable you to deeply grasp the core spirit of this civilization. This course will take thought as the core, literature as the content, and history as the stage to guide students into the classic hall.",
